%% Mermaid sequence diagram for employee CRUD
sequenceDiagram
    actor HR as HR User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Spring Boot)
    participant DB as MySQL

    HR->>FE: Open Employees Page
    FE->>BE: GET /api/employes
    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM employe
    DB-->>BE: Rows
    BE-->>FE: JSON list

    HR->>FE: Create employee
    FE->>BE: POST /api/employes { ... }
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO employe
    BE-->>FE: 200 OK (EmployeDto)
    FE->>BE: GET /api/employes (refresh)

    HR->>FE: Update employee
    FE->>BE: PUT /api/employes/{id}
    BE->>DB: UPDATE employe SET ... WHERE id={id}
    BE-->>FE: 200 OK

    HR->>FE: Delete employee
    FE->>BE: DELETE /api/employes/{id}
    BE->>DB: DELETE FROM employe WHERE id={id}
    BE-->>FE: 204 No Content

